        "created_at": "2019-09-23T22:45:43.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Hey everyone.</p>\n<p>I've been looking into making some characters, and I wanted someone else's opinion on how the Red Zone ability Endurance Fighting works.</p>\n<p>Endurance Fighting&nbsp;(Inherent) : Whenever you Attack a target with&nbsp;an action, also Hinder that target using your Min die.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>If a hero with Endurance Fighting Attacks a target using an ability, does Endurance Fighting still trigger?</p>\n<p>Hope someone can help me figure this out!</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:53:06.963Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
