        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/c/4491bb/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2019-09-24T21:03:43.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I was working on making a character who's fighting style of choice was best represented by them dealing out lots of Hinders, without applying them, and then invoking them all in a massive Finishing Blow. This lets me cut far closer to the flavor than I would have been able to otherwise.</p>",
