        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/c/4491bb/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2019-09-27T04:52:46.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I'll keep the multi-targeting aspect in mind, because that could definitely matter at some point.</p>\n<p>As for the fact that it only triggers in the Red Zone, I'll admit that it had slipped my mind at some point. However, it still fits the flavor of the character with how their fighting style would shift in as the situation get's worse.</p>",
